  "content": "<p>本模组在海洋中新增了一艘<strong>巨型灾厄村民战舰</strong>，满载战利品与珍贵物资。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/264/illager-warship.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/267/loot.png\" width=\"385\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>生成地点：</strong>该战舰会生成在所有<strong>海洋生物群系</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>灾厄船员：</strong>战舰由各类灾厄村民守卫，保护着船上的宝藏。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/269/side-view.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/268/rooms.png\" width=\"385\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>欢迎在本模组在整合包中使用</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">也来看看村民战舰模组：</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/92/ship.png\" width=\"385\" height=\"217\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-warship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-warship</a></span></p><hr><p>特别鸣谢 SirBlake</p>",
